  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (config_033) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder while maintaining scvi_n200 RNA encoder and weighted fusion, to isolate the impact of the image encoder's architecture. This is the best use of the remaining budget as it directly compares a stronger image encoder (ViT) against the current best, with minimal changes to other components."
